PARITY MAPPING  (web → Apple platform primitives/tokens; no Tailwind ported, no raw hex)
  MapContainer + MapTileLayer  → Map(position:) + .mapStyle(TSMapStyle.mapStyle) ; web 'dark' default → .standard
  Polyline (speed colour)      → MapPolyline(per pair).stroke(TripReplayPalette.color(for: band), 4)
  speedColor #10b981/#22d3ee/  → TripReplaySpeedBand slow/moderate/fast/veryFast → statusSuccess / accent /
    #f59e0b/#ef4444               statusWarning / statusDanger (theme-tracking semantic tokens, not raw hex)
  CircleMarker start/end/anchor→ Annotation { TSCircleMarker(tone: .success / .danger / .accent) }
  AnimatedMarker(heading)      → TripReplayPlayhead — a heading-rotated SF arrow ("location.north.fill") + a
                                 reduce-motion-aware pulse (TSAnimatedMarker has no heading param, so a faithful
                                 heading-aware playhead is composed; Reduce Motion suppresses the pulse = web fallback)
  FitBounds / useMap           → MapCameraPosition + TSMapCamera.fitting (TSGeo.boundingRegion) ; refit on route change
  handlePolylineClick → seek   → MapReader + MapProxy.convert(point,.local) → TripReplayGeo.nearestSampleIndex →
                                 model.seek(to:) → source (web onSeekToIndex; page stays the source of truth)
  MapLayerSwitcher             → TSMapLayerSwitcher (segmented Picker)
  GlassPanel                   → .tsGlassPanel material + rounded clip + border (the TSGlassPanel wrapper insets content
                                 by lg padding, which would inset the full-bleed map — so the same material is applied
                                 directly so the map bleeds to the panel edge, matching web overflow-hidden rounded-xl)
  EmptyState / AlertBanner     → TripReplayEmptyView / TripReplayStationaryBanner (facade-resolved subviews scoped to
                                 this surface, styled to the native TSEmptyState / TSAlertBanner look)
  haversine/isValid/route/…    → TripReplayGeo (Double maths, en-golden values asserted against the web expressions)
  i18n                         → every string via TripReplayMapStrings (NSLocalizedString table "TripReplayMap", web
                                 literal as the value: fallback) ; %@ template for the route a11y count
  a11y                         → map labelled (route / stationary summary) ; start/end/anchor/playhead + layer switcher +
                                 refresh + retry labelled ; Dynamic Type via tokens ; Reduce Motion via the playhead +
                                 TSSkeleton + the camera transition
  telemetry                    → view.opened surface="TripReplayMap" emitted once on first applied snapshot (P1/S11)

STATES (every one renders — no hidden surface)
  loading  → redacted skeleton map (parent isLoading with no samples yet).
  empty    → "No position data available for this drive" + a pin-slash icon (web positions.length===0), never blank.
  error    → retryable error chrome (P4 leaf addition; the web parent owns fetching).
  data     → the speed-coloured route + start/end pins + heading playhead + layer switcher; OR (stationary GPS) the
             single anchor marker + the "Route can't be plotted" banner — both reproduced.
  stale    → freshness chip + banner over the map + one-shot auto-refresh on the live→stale transition.
  offline  → freshness chip + banner over the last-loaded route; no auto-refresh.

